    "Id": "mechdef_tercio_TER-6",
    "Name": "Tercio 6",
    "Details": "The sixth Tercio design switches to Hardened Armor to create a much more durable variant. Even after the switch to the heavier armor there is still enough capacity left to mount a Heavy PPC in each side torso and an insulated Large ER Pulse Laser and a Streak SRM-6 launcher in each arm. The one clear downgrade over earlier designs is the need to switch to a 350 rated engine core, reducing the 'Mechs walk speed slightly.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.47</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_tercio"
  },
